/vendor/lensisku/dictionary-*.json -text

# The smusni-v0 bundle keeps its own copy of the dual-homed specification and
# recomputes digests over the vendored dictionary snapshot, and
# `crates/jbotci-semantics/build.rs` compares those bytes on every build. Git
# decides end-of-line conversion per path, so two copies of one document that
# disagree about the `text` attribute drift apart on a Windows checkout and
# nowhere else. Check every compared path out verbatim instead.
# `crates/jbotci-semantics/tests/smusni_v0_bundle.rs` keeps this closed over the
# generator's own input inventory rather than over these patterns.
/crates/jbotci-dictionary-data/data/** -text
/crates/jbotci-semantics/** -text
/docs/smusni/** -text
